=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  logforward review-move ---------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Decided: no Figma frame. mismatch's Set servers: hardn's file$
# rewritten for hardn.yml's server.$
$
  Checking the host...$
$
# Set servers ##################################################$
$
# Note$
# Every message the host logs goes to the server, as it is$
# logged.$
$
  Forwarding ---------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Server               192.0.2.60:514 TCP$
$
   -  Write hardn's forwarding file$
      /etc/rsyslog.d/60-hardn-forward.conf$
      @@ -1,5 +1,5 @@$
       # Written by hardn (Syslog Settings).$
       *.* action(type="omfwd" protocol="tcp"$
      -    target="192.0.2.50" port="514"$
      +    target="192.0.2.60" port="514"$
           queue.type="linkedList" queue.timeoutEnqueue="0"$
           action.resumeRetryCount="-1")$
      $ rsyslogd -N1$
$
   -  Restart rsyslog$
      rsyslog$
      $ systemctl restart rsyslog$
$
   -  Send a test line$
      $ logger -t hardn "log forwarding set"$
$
  Forward logs to 192.0.2.60? [y/N, 0 or q]: $
$
$

